<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Include &lt;<link linkend="_scalar__multiplication_8hpp">glm/gtx/scalar_multiplication.hpp</link>&gt; to use the features of this extension.</para>

<para>Enables scalar multiplication for all types</para>

<para>Since GLSL is very strict about types, the following (often used) combinations do not work: double * vec4 int * vec4 vec4 / int So we&apos;ll fix that! Of course &quot;float * vec4&quot; should remain the same (hence the enable_if magic)</para>
</section>
